  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Make a ranged creation attack against a target within range. On a hit, choose an ability score, either Strength or Dexterity. The target deals only half damage with weapon attacks that use the chosen ability modifier until the creation ends.\nAt the end of each of the target’s turns, it can make a Constitution saving throw against the creation. On a success, the creation ends.</p><p><strong>At Higher Levels.</strong> When you use this creation with a creation slot of 3rd or higher, you can target an additional creature within range for each slot above 2nd. Each creature must be within 30ft of eachother.</p>",
